(v) To pass an order for an enquiry for payment of additional mense profits to be computed in an appropriate Final Decree Proceedings in terms of Order COM.O.S.1179/2023 XX Rule 12 if the CPC to be computed from the date of termination of the tenancy till the date of delivery of possession of the Schedule Property in excess of Rs. 2,00,000/- per month or part thereof;
2. The Brief facts as per Plaint are as follows:-
2.1. The schedule property is the subject matter of lease by the Plaintiff in favour of the Defendant No. 1 a Partnership Firm of which the Defendants 2 and 3 are the Partners.
